    <header class="top">
      <div class="crumb"><span class="jd">38.02</span><span>Observability</span><span class="sep">/</span><b>/health</b></div>
      <div class="search"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><circle cx="11" cy="11" r="7"/><path d="m16.5 16.5 4 4"/></svg><span>Search everything</span><span class="k">⌘K</span></div>
      <div class="tacts">
        <span class="b n">anyone can open this page</span>
        <button class="btn"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M6 3h9l4 4v14H6z"/><path d="M9 13h7M9 17h4"/></svg>Export PDF</button>
      </div>
    </header>
    <div class="body">
      <div class="phead">
        <div>
          <p class="eyebrow">Four planes, one trace id</p>
          <h1>Is the system healthy?</h1>
          <p class="lede">A one-maintainer platform has to notice its own breakage before a person does. Every indicator clicks through to the query behind it, and every alert names the runbook that resolves it.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="sp"></div>
        <div class="seg">
          <sc-for list="{{planes}}" as="p" hint-placeholder-count="5">
            <button class="{{p.cls}}" onClick="{{p.pick}}">{{p.label}}</button>
          </sc-for>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="row" style="margin-bottom:14px">
        <sc-for list="{{summary}}" as="k" hint-placeholder-count="4">
          <div class="card" style="flex:1"><div class="cbd">
            <div class="kpi"><span class="l">{{k.l}}</span><span class="v" style="color:{{k.color}}">{{k.v}}</span><span class="d">{{k.d}}</span></div>
          </div></div>
        </sc-for>
      </div>

      <div class="row" style="align-items:flex-start">
        <div class="card" style="flex:1;min-width:0">
          <div class="chd"><h2>{{planeTitle}}</h2><div class="r"><span class="sub">{{planeNote}}</span></div></div>
          <div class="cbd flush">
            <table class="tbl">
              <thead><tr><th style="width:34px"></th><th>Indicator</th><th>Value</th><th>Window</th><th>Runbook</th></tr></thead>
              <tbody>
                <sc-for list="{{rows}}" as="r" hint-placeholder-count="8">
                  <tr class="hov">
                    <td><span style="display:block;width:9px;height:9px;border-radius:50%;background:{{r.color}}"></span></td>
                    <td><div style="font-weight:700">{{r.name}}</div><div style="color:#5A6E7A;font-size:11px;font-weight:600">{{r.note}}</div></td>
                    <td class="mono">{{r.value}}</td>
                    <td style="color:#5A6E7A">{{r.window}}</td>
                    <td><a>{{r.runbook}}</a></td>
                  </tr>
                </sc-for>
              </tbody>
            </table>
          </div>
          <div class="prov"><span>Alerts fire on symptoms, not causes</span><span>·</span><span>full logs 30 days · metrics 13 months · audit trails 7 years</span></div>
        </div>

        <div style="width:340px;flex:0 0 340px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:14px">
          <div class="card">
            <div class="chd"><h2>Modules</h2><div class="r"><span class="b g">19 green</span><span class="b k">1 amber</span><span class="b r">1 red</span></div></div>
            <div class="cbd" style="display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:6px">
              <sc-for list="{{modules}}" as="m" hint-placeholder-count="20">
                <span class="b {{m.tone}}" style="padding:3px 8px">{{m.name}}</span>
              </sc-for>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="card">
            <div class="chd"><h2>Open alert</h2><div class="r"><span class="b r dot">red</span></div></div>
            <div class="cbd" style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:10px">
              <div class="gate">
                <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M12 9v5M12 17h.01"/><path d="M10.3 4.3 2.6 18a2 2 0 0 0 1.7 3h15.4a2 2 0 0 0 1.7-3L13.7 4.3a2 2 0 0 0-3.4 0z"/></svg>
                <div><b>Progress Bible refresh has not succeeded since 2026-08-18.</b> Two impact metrics render their absence rather than a stale number, and the field reference views show the lag where the data is used.</div>
              </div>
              <div style="display:flex;gap:7px">
                <button class="btn sm p">Open runbook · pb-refresh</button>
                <button class="btn sm">Zulip thread</button>
              </div>
              <div style="color:#5A6E7A;font-size:11px;font-weight:600">Routed to #ops-alerts. An alert without a runbook is a defect in the alert.</div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="card">
            <div class="chd"><h2>Verification drills</h2></div>
            <div class="cbd" style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:0">
              <sc-for list="{{drills}}" as="d" hint-placeholder-count="4">
                <div style="display:flex;gap:10px;padding:7px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #F1F5F8">
                  <span class="b {{d.tone}}" style="height:17px">{{d.state}}</span>
                  <div><div style="font-weight:700;font-size:12.5px">{{d.name}}</div><div style="color:#5A6E7A;font-size:11px;font-weight:600">{{d.note}}</div></div>
                </div>
              </sc-for>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
